{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"35":"Combing the Hair (Kitab Al-Tarajjul)"},"section_detail":{"35":{"hadithnumber_first":4159,"hadithnumber_last":4213,"arabicnumber_first":4159,"arabicnumber_last":4213,"name_native":"كتاب الترجّل"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4162,"arabicnumber":4162,"text":"حدثنا نصر بن علي، حدثنا ابو احمد، عن شيبان بن عبد الرحمن، عن عبد الله بن المختار، عن موسى بن انس، عن انس بن مالك، قال كانت للنبي صلى الله عليه وسلم سكة يتطيب منها","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":35,"hadith":4}}]}